{"id": "official:sentence:63e2a6ec-3672-40ff-852b-2349583722c7", "text": "我尽快跑以赶上她。", "shortMeaning": "我快跑想追上她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca53db34-44b7-45d4-969a-cae24fbbc15f", "text": "我尽量不对我自己的笑话发笑，但是我们都知道我很搞笑。", "shortMeaning": "我尽量不对自己的笑话笑，但都知道我很搞笑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:498335bc-5c64-4bd2-9318-b3374679a9e8", "text": "我尽量留着胃吃甜点。", "shortMeaning": "我尽量留肚子吃甜点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c06869f-35d5-4679-9219-02fd05924bc4", "text": "我屏住了呼吸等待着。", "shortMeaning": "我屏住呼吸等待。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c55eab0-4d60-4454-954b-bfc1a6a2a371", "text": "我差不多五呎十一吋。", "shortMeaning": "我差不多五英尺十一英寸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:648ee0e6-623a-4cca-b6b2-b9daf344fa9a", "text": "我差不多做完，稍等一会儿。", "shortMeaning": "我快做完了，稍等一会儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2877c8a7-9718-43a4-bce8-4cc38fb191fb", "text": "我差点从悬崖上掉下去。", "shortMeaning": "我差点从悬崖掉下去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c82cf396-7b20-45a2-8438-2df6982e49da", "text": "我差点没去澳大利亚。", "shortMeaning": "我差点没去成澳大利亚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5af01231-d5d8-471f-b3fc-b006461ea727", "text": "我差点被一辆卡车碾过。", "shortMeaning": "我差点被卡车碾过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d49544e3-b391-40c4-a2a7-183f93bba979", "text": "我差点被卡车撞到。", "shortMeaning": "我差点被卡车撞上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:982530b7-9ef1-4247-b87f-5a56d3fa1940", "text": "我已告诉她要做什么。", "shortMeaning": "我已经告诉她该做什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b11ca714-0c97-45cc-bb76-084e805f1a86", "text": "我已经不再做这个了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经不做这个了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf0af57f-d220-4d7a-8541-7bdce25b9ece", "text": "我已经不带眼镜了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经不戴眼镜了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6507e868-d0b6-4cdc-9a35-38acc1305c6b", "text": "我已经两周没有见过您了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经两周没见过您了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fa04fbfc-a944-4401-9968-e82fd3acbbb7", "text": "我已经付过款了，请尽快发货。", "shortMeaning": "我已付款，请尽快发货。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46af5a8b-75ba-4999-8a87-63926c70eac7", "text": "我已经会写中文了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经会写汉字了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb9994ac-7141-4594-b720-f82766a7da0e", "text": "我已经做好了最坏的打算。", "shortMeaning": "我已有最坏的打算。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:182174a6-fe28-4e15-a11a-a19aa872c70a", "text": "我已经做得很有经验了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经很有经验了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3936c77f-c34d-48cb-94e1-16e2078c75ee", "text": "我已经写了三封信了。", "shortMeaning": "我写了三封信了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81127d4c-0792-432d-89f7-1d8b5fe9e973", "text": "我已经决定把我的头发剃了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经决定剃光头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:050fa7f0-f705-4bb5-bcbb-189556d54246", "text": "我已经几年没回去波士顿了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经几年没回波士顿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30d96748-cd7b-45a0-8ec3-d17eb8d4a46c", "text": "我已经厌倦地球的生活了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经厌倦了地球上的生活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d74cd64-8135-457c-a4da-71319aaf1138", "text": "我已经取了银行对账单。", "shortMeaning": "我取来了银行对账单。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:738d6b77-edf8-44e1-b909-bb48acaa7c6d", "text": "我已经受够了您的不断抱怨。", "shortMeaning": "您不停的抱怨我受够了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba75b84f-bd38-4bf1-8e3a-71ab9755028e", "text": "我已经受够了这个计划。", "shortMeaning": "我已经受够这个计划了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19f4b173-7b4c-414e-8ecc-32b4b3a7f6f3", "text": "我已经变了。我不再是原来的那个我了。", "shortMeaning": "我变了，不再是原来的我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cdd7357-8c66-4e1d-a733-f8e07d9c7407", "text": "我已经吃过早饭了。", "shortMeaning": "我吃过早饭了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:92a560c3-8e76-440a-bc0c-1ae5418a2423", "text": "我已经和你说过不要在你的房间吸烟。", "shortMeaning": "我跟你说过别在房间里吸烟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d5afc26-afad-40c8-9a5d-876515ea1de5", "text": "我已经唱了下一首歌好几次。", "shortMeaning": "我已经把下一首歌练唱了好几次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:078f7cbb-4552-4e9f-97b1-cdba8079a9fc", "text": "我已经在群里说了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经在群里说过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:718c1631-a53c-4cfc-b33e-59475bca16f6", "text": "我已经在这里工作几个小时了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经在这里工作几小时了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:abffc648-5b54-4e80-aee3-2967b9232b2b", "text": "我已经好久没有看到她了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经好久没看到她了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dadbad04-3736-4126-9cb2-6d5010367791", "text": "我已经学素描很久了，但依旧画不好。", "shortMeaning": "我学素描很久了，但依旧画不好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6287681e-efc9-4c69-bb7d-982e1f10cd65", "text": "我已经开始了我的安卓编程之旅。", "shortMeaning": "我已经开始安卓编程之旅。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4ddcef2-3f0a-40a6-82e1-1db69a93cd9e", "text": "我已经很久没有写诗了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经很久没写诗了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:592e24b7-e3eb-4b5e-8d26-dda764775099", "text": "我已经很久没有画漫画了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经很久没画漫画了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c5f705a8-20a7-4c1a-9dc5-c07071f11b92", "text": "我已经很久没有看见过比尔了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经很久没看见比尔了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:03072ed7-16c9-4875-abde-b0ff43753c26", "text": "我已经很久没这么惊喜过了。", "shortMeaning": "我很久没这么惊喜过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:39e36b60-9d5e-46d4-a101-f6b443f1771e", "text": "我已经忘了他的名字。", "shortMeaning": "我忘了他的名字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5faddeb4-e868-479a-831a-0991f19c9aab", "text": "我已经忘记这些单词了。", "shortMeaning": "这些单词我已经忘了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:89c89ffa-58a4-40f5-ad2e-7a32cdeff98f", "text": "我已经想要读一读了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经想读一读了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96ade777-b17c-48e2-a516-21835c356c43", "text": "我已经把它买下来了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经买下它了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d429dff7-f3a2-4365-b445-2d3c2f79cc62", "text": "我已经有一个月没她的消息了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经一个月没她的消息了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bef2d972-5de2-4bca-a49c-2d32f8e07ee1", "text": "我已经注意你一阵子了。", "shortMeaning": "我注意你有一阵子了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cbb47246-9dc3-45b5-b98d-dafbd00223c0", "text": "我已经活了大半辈子了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经活了半辈子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7663b80a-bf09-4b20-b56e-cf4210ec4f9a", "text": "我已经游览过澳大利亚了。", "shortMeaning": "我游览过澳大利亚了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de398346-9a9a-45ee-ad53-d7720e7a6284", "text": "我已经看完这本书了。", "shortMeaning": "这本书我看完了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a1b7a33-7f8f-4d42-b71d-a1c4522b494a", "text": "我已经看过这本书了。", "shortMeaning": "这本书我读过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d777b00a-840b-46e3-95a6-9e964180f116", "text": "我已经看过这部电影了。", "shortMeaning": "这部电影我看过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2013d7e-a98d-45dd-a771-cdf4ebd697b3", "text": "我已经知道你想要什么！", "shortMeaning": "我早知道你想要什么！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f16a89f-ea4e-437b-8fa7-8bdb6ba72bfa", "text": "我已经考虑过那种可能性了。", "shortMeaning": "那种可能性我想过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e1bb9f1-18ed-412f-a733-80d61cc031ed", "text": "我已经能像个本地人一样说这门语言了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经能像本地人一样说这门语言了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d29748c2-5eac-466e-b540-bcc44df0d24c", "text": "我已经见过他很多次了。", "shortMeaning": "我见过他很多次了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f6577248-383a-48e2-8170-4e86b514a599", "text": "我已经解释很多遍了。", "shortMeaning": "我解释过很多遍了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b5320e4-1a25-47e9-b553-13961e01a159", "text": "我已经试过那个了。", "shortMeaning": "那个我试过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc02383d-8b62-4dbb-b226-0d5735ceecfa", "text": "我已经读完了所有哈利·波特书。", "shortMeaning": "哈利·波特的书我全读完了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e49e49c9-4afc-4751-9511-d1aecb9551fb", "text": "我已经读过很多种类的书了。", "shortMeaning": "我读过很多种书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02872f12-4355-4a89-b99b-12021c3c6ce8", "text": "我已经跟经理谈话了。", "shortMeaning": "我已经跟经理谈过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2901ca87-56d2-4137-a02e-e3d70ab475d0", "text": "我已经退休三年了。", "shortMeaning": "我退休三年了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f4f63e4-00ba-4b52-9641-4a48f37fff61", "text": "我已经醒了一会儿了。", "shortMeaning": "我醒过来有一会儿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:01e30237-c987-40ee-8bda-34bf2040e2e3", "text": "我已见过他好几次。", "shortMeaning": "我见过他好几次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc8994c9-7d92-4e63-a5b3-b96061f05848", "text": "我希望一切都顺利。", "shortMeaning": "我希望一切顺利。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:028ece4f-8da3-4775-8f44-fd67cfea4e5b", "text": "我希望下周不要再生病了。", "shortMeaning": "我希望下周别再生病。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5db0062-832c-40fc-9f3b-d5b1cb64d0ee", "text": "我希望下次你会小心点。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你下次小心点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56aa16a0-8d75-4254-b976-5a7b835f6bd1", "text": "我希望下次你在东京的时候可以见到你。", "shortMeaning": "我希望下次你在东京时能见到你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b8036ba-1237-441a-9b8a-1cafc5e3fe58", "text": "我希望下次能唱得好一点。", "shortMeaning": "我希望下次能唱得更好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53425a5a-4d63-44f7-aa72-89223f2c47db", "text": "我希望了解您的国家。", "shortMeaning": "我想了解您的国家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ed00ad61-63a1-4754-aa94-533db33d0ba5", "text": "我希望人们友好相处，世界更加美好。", "shortMeaning": "我希望人们友好相处，世界更美好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11aab788-d69a-46b3-95a2-2bd5dec99e68", "text": "我希望今天的天气是晴朗的。", "shortMeaning": "我希望今天是晴天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f73b805-b1aa-48da-916a-548f959b9d88", "text": "我希望今晚能见到她。", "shortMeaning": "我盼着今晚见到她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d4e558a-a9a1-4667-a48c-60464f2cfad5", "text": "我希望他们能和平地解决。", "shortMeaning": "我希望他们能和平解决。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c321a92b-8856-4614-a32e-8978b2de9bb6", "text": "我希望他停止吸烟。", "shortMeaning": "我希望他戒烟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f158695a-d4e7-426c-be00-d6165f564dc2", "text": "我希望他很快就能好起来。", "shortMeaning": "我希望他很快好起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd0e4948-4e08-421d-b2d5-f4f7adac9a61", "text": "我希望他来信更勤些。", "shortMeaning": "我希望他多来信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8dfc429a-86df-4f94-b184-ad9b6faee082", "text": "我希望住在你家附近。", "shortMeaning": "我想住在你家附近。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23fd3931-e7f9-45a5-8aef-2ce079e36043", "text": "我希望你不要讲谎话。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你别讲谎话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56cdc0b3-003a-4143-b81c-0ea2184b2f3f", "text": "我希望你们一切顺利。", "shortMeaning": "祝你们一切顺利。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4dd0dad0-1920-4f0b-8853-5ab3ed1a2ecd", "text": "我希望你和她留在这。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你和她留在这里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38a5fc9a-d786-45c2-8b0a-7996fcdb573f", "text": "我希望你喜欢这个工作。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你喜欢这份工作。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:976f9334-b607-43d7-a027-f8f669affa46", "text": "我希望你在和我说实话。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你在对我说实话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d9b4b9e-b9d1-4b0c-9fc3-021d7030531c", "text": "我希望你在我身边。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你陪着我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40fac610-b907-41bb-a86f-ec07aae0fad2", "text": "我希望你对我说实话。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你跟我讲实话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8731b869-ba8c-47a8-bbee-1c7d6657a6bb", "text": "我希望你对此保密。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你保守这个秘密。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e0c3186-d3da-459a-a1bd-bf0552014b31", "text": "我希望你很快就能痊愈。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你很快痊愈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ccfb276d-a67f-46f0-a9da-eeb50a7a1088", "text": "我希望你早点告诉我。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你早些告诉我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c64323a7-e180-47c6-8c5a-38d86106d391", "text": "我希望你早点回来。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你早些回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a2678545-b3d9-452f-b6f0-533a562a26b5", "text": "我希望你没出任何问题。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你一切平安。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a37b87b3-1ccc-4d52-9441-3c55669e922c", "text": "我希望你的梦想全部都能实现。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你的梦想全部实现。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:643301e1-16f0-4495-a545-b54141e4cce6", "text": "我希望你能去那里。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你能去那儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6168c171-2888-4da7-985d-cda95f8e110c", "text": "我希望你能唱一首歌。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你唱首歌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a406da3e-2b41-48fe-b8f7-aa22165251dc", "text": "我希望你能安静一点。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你安静一点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b1a815eb-22f8-4c51-8984-e8bc8032b6cd", "text": "我希望你能接受我的要求。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你答应我的请求。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16acd352-3acf-48c9-8bb3-58a93f7d88a4", "text": "我希望你能早日回信。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你早日回信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4958bf79-bc6c-4c6b-9799-5c38dce3971a", "text": "我希望你能读完这本书。", "shortMeaning": "我希望你读完这本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:93396791-1145-4f5c-a869-b08fb841cce7", "text": "我希望再次见到它。", "shortMeaning": "我想再见它一次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:720ccaa4-be27-4d44-8aaa-141b4fd16b57", "text": "我希望再次见到您。", "shortMeaning": "我想再见您一次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2481a340-f9a6-4400-bee9-858584ed8333", "text": "我希望再爬一次上富士山。", "shortMeaning": "我希望再爬一次富士山。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9f7cb19-5dc2-4ade-9c01-c0865e504f02", "text": "我希望只有这一个。", "shortMeaning": "我希望仅此一个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8ecc4a56-f105-4285-856e-dcfac6411592", "text": "我希望在我去世后有人记得我。", "shortMeaning": "我希望去世后有人记得我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4bfe24a6-680f-4fad-a9e2-3e4e72f36b77", "text": "我希望妈妈现在就能回家。", "shortMeaning": "我希望妈妈现在就回家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1dc6c0fe-3746-4382-9700-a943c58920ce", "text": "我希望将来成为一名牙医。", "shortMeaning": "我将来想当牙医。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3684a654-d2ed-41dc-9243-858fd3b1bec6", "text": "我希望当我在想我希望我是谁的时候我就是谁。", "shortMeaning": "我希望想成为谁就能成为谁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d4fca45-b35b-4e7f-88ee-f62ba57826aa", "text": "我希望当时我不用一个人做那件事。", "shortMeaning": "我希望当时不用一个人做那件事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84970d14-669c-473f-bccb-9f9d87883bff", "text": "我希望当时能陪你们度过难关。", "shortMeaning": "我希望当时能陪你们渡过难关。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fe838077-27d4-4d88-8051-6af73e62452c", "text": "我希望您快就会好起来。", "shortMeaning": "我希望您很快好起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58a1722f-c6bc-4f34-b2be-49ca7ba82242", "text": "我希望成为一名歌手。", "shortMeaning": "我想当一名歌手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23c9fb03-c694-4685-a59b-ad2e15ddbcdf", "text": "我希望我们不用等太久。", "shortMeaning": "但愿我们不必等太久。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8058fb29-6a73-4be8-9315-af922ef41b0c", "text": "我希望我们能保持联系。", "shortMeaning": "但愿我们能保持联络。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1486e744-b9bb-498e-af3e-ea79c7a481d8", "text": "我希望我是一块石头。", "shortMeaning": "我希望自己是块石头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d6fb8263-f2a3-4aa0-8a60-6ed9565ce535", "text": "我希望我没有得到职位。", "shortMeaning": "我希望我没有得到那个职位。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05b6e62f-ff6e-4894-88bb-564bc704ed3f", "text": "我希望我的梦想实现。", "shortMeaning": "我希望梦想成真。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6f79bc3-ac88-44b9-b221-769645591c60", "text": "我希望我能买下你想要的所有东西。", "shortMeaning": "我希望我能买下你想要的一切。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c88b78a-5a52-4274-b88a-f13805b9529b", "text": "我希望我能停止打嗝。", "shortMeaning": "我希望我能止住打嗝。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:948843ff-4c3a-4737-9086-dcad870851a4", "text": "我希望我能和你一起参加派对。", "shortMeaning": "我希望与你一起参加派对。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8de09a71-db06-4c83-9154-55cb7e8cd8c8", "text": "我希望我能和她多谈一会儿。", "shortMeaning": "我希望能跟她多聊一会儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b636b9f-8d46-4cad-a99d-765a484f7907", "text": "我希望我能被人重视。", "shortMeaning": "我希望得到别人重视。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08a3646e-263a-431b-88d8-3eb285e8dcf8", "text": "我希望我能说法语说得更好。", "shortMeaning": "我希望法语能说得更好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2565b761-db7e-4773-aa00-9c1c9235518a", "text": "我希望我这么做不会后悔的。", "shortMeaning": "我希望这么做不会后悔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52ac2b4d-be4a-4027-81eb-cc5c6140e53a", "text": "我希望更多人也能感受到。", "shortMeaning": "我希望更多人也感受到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c95c1dcb-4efa-4be0-a43d-5cad457d5349", "text": "我希望最后一切都好。", "shortMeaning": "但愿最后一切安好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02243144-d563-465d-8c0f-2cfef5d438b0", "text": "我希望有一天去埃及。", "shortMeaning": "我希望有朝一日去埃及。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:82dd94f1-94aa-4a98-b703-cb02c712516b", "text": "我希望有人能教我英语作文。", "shortMeaning": "我希望有人教我英语作文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:abc0daf1-fcf7-49fa-aeb6-7789529ea65e", "text": "我希望有朝一日去日本。", "shortMeaning": "我希望有一天去日本。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26c325f4-b87c-433f-bd3e-4763a7eed11e", "text": "我希望没打扰到你吧？", "shortMeaning": "没打扰到你吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9a7bd8b-15f1-4d2f-b48b-d93a63c067fe", "text": "我希望离开那个城市，并且不再回来。", "shortMeaning": "我希望离开那座城市，不再回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb1cfe19-c451-480f-a23c-057d55614194", "text": "我希望经济很快复苏起来。", "shortMeaning": "我希望经济很快复苏。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:50a4ea50-ff65-4c42-abad-04356d0bd6fc", "text": "我希望能一直保持这样。", "shortMeaning": "我希望一直这样保持下去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:984fe33e-9389-4b43-91e6-afeafc217c0f", "text": "我希望能与你谈话。", "shortMeaning": "我想和你谈谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1edf667-ac2a-4938-9915-832cd2aeaaa5", "text": "我希望能再一次和你交谈。", "shortMeaning": "我希望能再和你交谈一次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0fa71182-d52a-4156-9e4a-70d8e59d54a0", "text": "我希望能够做到每周给房间打扫一次卫生。", "shortMeaning": "我希望每周给房间打扫一次卫生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:89abd1af-daf7-4fd0-8bf1-dbc896924768", "text": "我希望能够去到波士顿。", "shortMeaning": "我希望能够去波士顿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e007ef6c-1b1c-4e05-a1e9-c968574bc2af", "text": "我希望过几个月后我还能通过正常手段登上这个网站。", "shortMeaning": "我希望几个月后还能正常登上这个网站。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c8c69d0a-28d9-491c-b91d-4a966bd04a52", "text": "我带去派对的瓶装啤酒是多余的；我们的主人家有间酒厂。", "shortMeaning": "我带去派对的瓶装啤酒是多余的，主人家有酒厂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b9901099-a834-4d52-9836-851b809da04f", "text": "我带着一身疲惫回了家。", "shortMeaning": "我疲惫不堪地回了家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9fb6ec55-c978-4f6e-a3df-9a2d8adbb44b", "text": "我帮他买了一条领带。", "shortMeaning": "我替他买了条领带。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f92d1636-4845-474c-bdd5-37c82022934b", "text": "我常对自己这么说。", "shortMeaning": "我常这样对自己说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a331085c-694d-4b30-9f40-6406e3af0a8d", "text": "我常常在我的闲暇时候听广播。", "shortMeaning": "我常在闲暇时听广播。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6eb57e9c-9318-4158-b85e-4788f17004e9", "text": "我常常在这个地方。", "shortMeaning": "我常在这个地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8246f6c-9cdf-48b9-a195-798cbf39f56c", "text": "我常常能分辨出来一个人是不是瞒着我什么事情。", "shortMeaning": "我常能看出一个人是否瞒着我什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5491be4a-a470-438e-a1c8-15ce01114ba8", "text": "我常常访问我的亲戚。", "shortMeaning": "我常常拜访亲戚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:784a3308-41c1-4496-b404-d1eaacd2f55b", "text": "我干了件什么傻事啊！", "shortMeaning": "我干了多傻的一件事啊！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c51d4b14-aec5-4280-b322-606a1ec5edad", "text": "我干了很多我妈不知道的事。", "shortMeaning": "我做了很多我妈不知道的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f9c03eb0-1efe-49d2-8cf5-bd55406afd84", "text": "我干这一行已经很久了。", "shortMeaning": "我干这行已经很久了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:744adfe1-1e31-4e5e-85b1-fb0543826b37", "text": "我平常早上八点钟起床。", "shortMeaning": "我平常早上八点起床。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ccba0727-7fc1-48eb-9ae0-e3d06e276dcd", "text": "我平常醒得特别早。", "shortMeaning": "我通常醒得很早。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f06efe49-fecc-4803-af74-fe903996f015", "text": "我年轻时经常打网球。", "shortMeaning": "我年轻时常打网球。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:de969ee3-ed21-48bb-9746-187060f33353", "text": "我并没有义务帮助你。", "shortMeaning": "我并没有帮你的义务。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b62efbaf-a8f2-4015-b85b-257a38fbcbb6", "text": "我应该取消我到洛杉矶的旅行。", "shortMeaning": "我应该取消洛杉矶之行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49a4df22-15a5-4130-a3d8-05cfad50cddf", "text": "我应该坐上公交车吗？", "shortMeaning": "我该坐公交车吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:743d6214-507f-4955-834d-fd30684b2ba2", "text": "我应该学习世界语。", "shortMeaning": "我应该学世界语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23fa769d-a78d-4d5d-8c12-e7a6d34a9002", "text": "我应该往你的咖啡里放多少糖呢？", "shortMeaning": "你的咖啡我该放多少糖呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3554f20-23af-48ea-a3fd-27b4206c1521", "text": "我建议你的儿子来参加我们的派对。", "shortMeaning": "我建议你儿子来参加我们的派对。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:212587ea-dc01-49b2-b7c7-31df57619f2b", "text": "我建议我们星期五出去玩。", "shortMeaning": "我提议周五出去玩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ddb76cd1-a8bf-43dc-aad6-dec409af467b", "text": "我开车去了城市买东西。", "shortMeaning": "我开车去城里买东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:520b7eac-939e-4671-993d-844117b237b8", "text": "我开门的时候弄坏了锁。", "shortMeaning": "我开门时弄坏了锁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98506462-dc16-4986-b911-6aed9e5c5d79", "text": "我弄了一份请愿书要求在大学食堂提供无花果饼干，你们愿意签名吗？", "shortMeaning": "我弄了份请愿书要大学食堂提供无花果饼干，你们愿意签名吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8713d29-e666-4cff-8bb0-dacca600e13d", "text": "我弄断了我吉他的一根弦。", "shortMeaning": "我弄断了吉他的一根弦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6dc4967f-551e-4d86-bcd8-ad7b41085fce", "text": "我弄清楚她在哪儿了。", "shortMeaning": "我弄清她在哪儿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6799bb77-2205-4f9b-be6f-41835fc9649f", "text": "我弟弟和我在做俄文作业。", "shortMeaning": "我和弟弟在做俄文作业。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c59913a-cc6d-486f-b0ed-9b7b3054849b", "text": "我弟弟很喜欢拍山的照片。", "shortMeaning": "我弟弟爱拍山的照片。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffbe7361-feb2-406f-a54b-3baf4fc0f7be", "text": "我弟觉得他比我强，但他才六岁。", "shortMeaning": "我弟觉得他比我强，可他才六岁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c980fbbc-f9eb-49cb-ad64-24f7ac765da9", "text": "我当初要是买音乐会的票就好了。", "shortMeaning": "我当初要是买了音乐会票就好了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a795b4d-0f26-40ca-afd2-2d005124123c", "text": "我当时一定很吓人。", "shortMeaning": "我当时肯定很吓人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e232555f-e03f-44ab-ac70-e72f1fa5444c", "text": "我当时也怀有幻想。", "shortMeaning": "我当时也抱有幻想。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:72991a10-1b8f-4237-b470-848797dbd5d5", "text": "我当时正忙着打包，因为我两天后要去法国。", "shortMeaning": "我两天后要去法国，当时正忙着打包。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b0870e2-9c41-4f0c-a947-92e572140cff", "text": "我当时每个月都会购买五本书。", "shortMeaning": "我当时每月买五本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2b48e96-284d-4176-ad3d-200be12f3b8d", "text": "我当然希望这是一个梦。", "shortMeaning": "我当然希望这是场梦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:85c7af9d-8ac7-4500-bb5a-16782f932d87", "text": "我当然有资格这么说啦。", "shortMeaning": "我当然有资格这么说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6c4240f6-b974-4add-b8d9-5e225d3ad771", "text": "我当然知道你要来。", "shortMeaning": "我自然知道你要来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6ab5a45c-30cc-49c5-91e3-6b94532f3c71", "text": "我录下了我们的谈话。", "shortMeaning": "我把我们的谈话录下来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a31c3a2c-51d2-4774-b94b-11de873d1cdf", "text": "我彻底无语了，你简直就是个无赖！", "shortMeaning": "我彻底无语了，你简直是个无赖！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34bb1858-93ab-47fb-b298-b0d16fc2ec56", "text": "我很久没有抽烟了。", "shortMeaning": "我很久没抽烟了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7203ac1d-3d1e-4d2b-aaa2-c1c1efc76494", "text": "我很久没见过他了。", "shortMeaning": "我很久没见他了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebf02a53-3cbd-46b5-b2b5-67b361ef7155", "text": "我很冷。你介意把暖气打开吗？", "shortMeaning": "我很冷，你介意打开暖气吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5000f1e4-5d8c-40fd-ab2c-64b5c5e794f0", "text": "我很喜欢学习中文。", "shortMeaning": "我很喜欢学中文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:319321a9-de2c-4206-9089-f26009040495", "text": "我很困倦，所以我打哈欠。", "shortMeaning": "我很困，所以打哈欠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9958dba-bcf5-405b-86df-4fa22676991c", "text": "我很好奇那个建筑物是什么时候建造的。", "shortMeaning": "我很好奇那座建筑是什么时候建的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4da804a4-2b81-4cac-ae11-507410113846", "text": "我很小的时候就游得很好了。", "shortMeaning": "我很小就会游泳了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1b2c07e-d369-4064-8073-12d921c34722", "text": "我很小的时候，我母亲就去世了。", "shortMeaning": "我母亲在我很小的时候就去世了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38fe79b8-b2a2-4a1c-9bda-c1eb971928bb", "text": "我很希望你会再来。", "shortMeaning": "我很希望你再来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9b9c523-a012-4d5e-8e47-93f06a6298f0", "text": "我很希望可以说一口地道的中文。", "shortMeaning": "我很希望说一口地道的中文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c19181a6-8168-4b48-a367-e7c90cef9855", "text": "我很平静，直到我看到了注射器。", "shortMeaning": "我一直很平静，直到看见注射器。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebf165f9-363c-46ad-af74-8770018dabbf", "text": "我很幸运的，脱身无伤。", "shortMeaning": "我很幸运，毫发无伤地脱身。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91fd1c0b-da25-4e0f-8d98-f8cf7e40d9ba", "text": "我很庆幸我们没有去那儿，因为当时那儿有局部大暴雨。", "shortMeaning": "我庆幸我们没去那儿，因为当时有局部暴雨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56fdb4b0-5b6e-43ff-aa62-f25a0afd1c10", "text": "我很庆幸没买这种东西。", "shortMeaning": "幸好没买这种东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b0187dd7-1df9-465a-a7e9-e9f3aeae1217", "text": "我很开心你不在我朋友卷里。", "shortMeaning": "我很开心你不在我朋友之列。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aae640e0-74f1-49b3-8de2-033c0e9ed008", "text": "我很忙，所以我不能去了。", "shortMeaning": "我很忙，所以去不了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69204326-6782-4143-ae08-3be14f60820b", "text": "我很怀念我的童年。", "shortMeaning": "我很怀念童年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54e6fd3e-2664-4bdc-950b-4c2c1cd14176", "text": "我很怀疑他们的计划是否能够成功。", "shortMeaning": "我很怀疑他们的计划能否成功。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8be8f590-1cb9-405b-b0e8-5b11ac6887d5", "text": "我很思念过去的日子。", "shortMeaning": "我很想念从前的日子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:58b4eccc-e27c-4f77-a889-cffa582721a8", "text": "我很惊讶你们竟然那么天真。", "shortMeaning": "我很惊讶你们竟那么天真。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f037b974-7808-47f4-ac2f-b345c154e0e1", "text": "我很惊讶你得了奖。", "shortMeaning": "你得奖让我很惊讶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d69c835c-966e-4f81-a779-3fef102c0496", "text": "我很惊讶你竟然那么天真。", "shortMeaning": "我很惊讶你竟那么天真。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0da4ae69-e6e1-4e8f-a10d-fc90c47f3119", "text": "我很惊讶在这儿看到你。", "shortMeaning": "我很惊讶在这儿见到你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37bd2fd8-f864-4e11-87fd-4715d214584e", "text": "我很惊讶您竟然那么天真。", "shortMeaning": "我很惊讶您竟那么天真。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3fcb2fb-0bca-4221-98c7-5aa5b6bc7c6e", "text": "我很惊讶，你家居然有辆日本车。", "shortMeaning": "我很惊讶你家居然有日本车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a886b15b-5ed6-4d5b-9177-4d19f4c5f449", "text": "我很惊讶，你竟然不知道他们结婚了。", "shortMeaning": "我很惊讶你竟不知道他们结婚了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a5d55da-dfaf-4317-915d-40a92718575e", "text": "我很惭愧，这是我第一次对我爸说谎。", "shortMeaning": "我很惭愧，这是我第一次对爸爸说谎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c576e17-0f30-40c6-8a40-16f979f891f7", "text": "我很想找出她为什么这么说的原因。", "shortMeaning": "我很想弄清她为什么这么说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76638600-3e52-47ea-9fc9-cff41b6a78c9", "text": "我很想流利地说英语。", "shortMeaning": "我很想把英语说流利。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
